er path <-> protected 1S pack+NTC -> 3.8V modem / host rails / 5V VBUS / audio rail. Not drawn circuitry."(at 25 510 0)(effects(font(size 1.5 1.5))(justify left))(uuid "1f2e9863-d757-4437-8747-cbfdcdafceb5")))